      "created_at": "2023-04-26T10:58:07.588Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Grand Warlord Voss crosses dimensional boundaries to invade Freedom City. It’s up to Daedalus, Siren, Captain Thunder, Dr. Metropolis and Star Knight to repel the Torathian invasion.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lQiPz2zy3P13hosB15PqCkfA1BO\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/9/99173bea8e82ca5af8cd215f1cffbbf4ef029afc_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 138 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>And repel it they did. Siren and Star Knight ran the show here with the others providing damage and clean up. Siren developed a storm that involved enough weather effects to fully flummox the low level minions and provide support for the rest of the party. Star Knight’s gear provides a lot of damage opportunities that when boosted start to chunk out Voss’s health quickly. In the end, a Ravenous Whirlpool swallowed Voss and his army beneath the waves, never to be seen again.</p>",
