      "created_at": "2023-04-26T17:47:29.053Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not too hard, but it was a good intro to a couple of characters I hadn’t gotten around to trying out yet. I’m still not <em>entirely</em> sure how to get good use out of Star Knight aside from having a lot of strong top-decking heroes supporting her, but I bet it’ll come to me.</p>\n<p>That’s six out of ten heroes displayed in two one-shots, plus one of four villains. Anyone care to place bets on if the next three one-shots each include one villain and 1-2 heroes to round out the set?</p>",
